  "prefLabel": "Cla 201.09 Motion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cla 201.09 \"Motion\" means a request to the presiding officer for an order or ruling directing some act to be done in favor of the proponent of the motion, including a statement of justification or reasons for the request.\n\nSource. #8509, eff 12-09-05",
